                    "system": {
                        "id": "burn-tin",
                        "type": "metallic-arts",
                        "description": {
                            "value": "<p>To burn tin, spend 1 Investiture or more, up to your Metallic Art limit, gaining the following benefits for a number of rounds equal to your ranks in <strong>Allomancy</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>You become @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.b684FTgeTTE90HLs.JournalEntryPage.vyYzxzfhwORSeTLw#enhanced]{Enhanced} [<strong>Awareness</strong>]. The bonus to this attribute equals half the Investiture you spent to burn tin (rounded up).</p></li><li><p>Each of your senses is a supernatural sense, making you more aware but vulnerable (see “@UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.kwz9u1ntb7EcYxTk.JournalEntryPage.nOLzM4Ep16ZxoRfj#supernatural-senses]{Supernatural Senses}” in chapter 3).</p></li></ul><p>Before your tin burn ends, you can spend 1 Investiture or more as <span class=\"cosmere-icon\">0</span> to maintain it for the corresponding duration.</p>",
